(3848692, 543992, 48471, '<td valign="top">I beg to try the following: get rid of the top half! get rid of the house and the forest in the back, and you''ll get a great, almost abstract universe of thousands of suns.</td>', 'I beg to try the following: get rid of the top half! get rid of the house and the forest in the back, and you''ll get a great, almost abstract universe of thousands of suns.', '2007-06-29 12:58:05.000000', NULL, 1);
<br/> <br/>Now, while still headless from previous experiences, I''m trying to move on and return to life of colours, but the scars are still there: the shadow still makes me intuitively move my had close to the pocket.<br/> <br/>I guess...<br/> <br/>Anyhow, one of the best photos in general, and street photos, in particular. Congratulations for a great capture.</td>', 'When I started windowshopping and marvelling the perfect dolls of design industries, colour-coolness and hippines left the frame of my vision, and I turned into a shadow, a faceless shadow firmly holding my empty bags. Now, while still headless from previous experiences, I''m trying to move on and return to life of colours, but the scars are still there: the shadow still makes me intuitively move my had close to the pocket. I guess... Anyhow, one of the best photos in general, and street photos, in particular. Congratulations for a great capture.', '2007-06-30 00:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3850213, 541860, 48471, '<td valign="top">Great bokeh, great darks! The red pops out of the picture, the blue, the yellow, the green push it out of the picture. And the darks, the shadows grab my attention and don''t let me go out of this photo.</td>', 'Great bokeh, great darks! The red pops out of the picture, the blue, the yellow, the green push it out of the picture. And the darks, the shadows grab my attention and don''t let me go out of this photo.', '2007-06-30 00:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3850218, 540812, 48471, '<td valign="top">If I may comment: this is a lazy photo! Yes, it meets the challenge, because you have singled out your subject by colour, but there''s nothing else except that, not even focus, no fancy composition, no school work (I don''t understand how song lyrics are related to school work). I think this is a waste of a good idea. Please, go back to this shot again, try it with different lightning, with different composition, work on the image more that just one snap.</td>', 'If I may comment: this is a lazy photo! Yes, it meets the challenge, because you have singled out your subject by colour, but there''s nothing else except that, not even focus, no fancy composition, no school work (I don''t understand how song lyrics are related to school work). I think this is a waste of a good idea. Please, go back to this shot again, try it with different lightning, with different composition, work on the image more that just one snap.', '2007-06-30 00:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3850225, 543341, 48471, '<td valign="top">Wonderful idea, great realization of a very difficult subject. I believe this was done at sea, with natural light, not in a place where you can control light.</td>', 'Wonderful idea, great realization of a very difficult subject. I believe this was done at sea, with natural light, not in a place where you can control light.', '2007-06-30 00:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
