(3854696, 544086, 18367, '<td valign="top">I simply love the juxtaposition presented in this image... colourful vs bland ... live vs death.  A great image that conveys a very emotive and powerful message.  Well done.</td>', 'I simply love the juxtaposition presented in this image... colourful vs bland ... live vs death.  A great image that conveys a very emotive and powerful message.  Well done.', '2007-07-01 19:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
