(3866737, 542224, 51538, '<td valign="top">I well remember picking up Baltic amber and jet from such tidal inlets near Hunstanton/Sandringham and picking <a href="//www.bbc.co.uk/norfolk/your/a-z_norfolk/a-z_samphire.shtml" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">samphire</a> (pronounced sanfer) in Norfolk.  Sanfer is delicious.  Nice photo, BTW.  Takes me back in time to  many a trip to Norfolk and an old girlfriend.</td>', 'I well remember picking up Baltic amber and jet from such tidal inlets near Hunstanton/Sandringham and picking samphire (pronounced sanfer) in Norfolk.  Sanfer is delicious.  Nice photo, BTW.  Takes me back in time to  many a trip to Norfolk and an old girlfriend.', '2007-07-04 10:19:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(3866742, 542388, 55397, '<td valign="top">That''s my boy!  As your mom, Tim, I have always enjoyed the new ''pets'' you brought into the house - the snakes, the tarantulas, the newts, the turtles, the hamsters (all named Hester), the mice to feed the snakes, the anoles, the crickets to feed whomever.  All the animals, and you, continue to create so many smiles.  You warm my heart.  Congratulations on your Blue Ribbon!</td>', 'That''s my boy!  As your mom, Tim, I have always enjoyed the new ''pets'' you brought into the house - the snakes, the tarantulas, the newts, the turtles, the hamsters (all named Hester), the mice to feed the snakes, the anoles, the crickets to feed whomever.  All the animals, and you, continue to create so many smiles.  You warm my heart.  Congratulations on your Blue Ribbon!', '2007-07-04 10:20:52.000000', NULL, 0),
