(3866786, 542388, 53147, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by sukilynner:</b></div><hr/><i> That''s my boy!  As your mom, Tim, I have always enjoyed the new ''pets'' you brought into the house - the snakes, the tarantulas, the newts, the turtles, the hamsters (all named Hester), the mice to feed the snakes, the anoles, the crickets to feed whomever.  All the animals, and you, continue to create so many smiles.  You warm my heart.  Congratulations on your Blue Ribbon! </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Thanks mom! ;)</td>', 'Originally posted by sukilynner: That''s my boy!  As your mom, Tim, I have always enjoyed the new ''pets'' you brought into the house - the snakes, the tarantulas, the newts, the turtles, the hamsters (all named Hester), the mice to feed the snakes, the anoles, the crickets to feed whomever.  All the animals, and you, continue to create so many smiles.  You warm my heart.  Congratulations on your Blue Ribbon!  Thanks mom! ;)', '2007-07-04 10:29:25.000000', NULL, 0),
