(3866818, 543163, 53572, '<td valign="top">i think the criticisms that have come before are all valid (size, slant) so i''ll go with what i like.  the subtlety is good, but i do believe a close up of only the bar, mesh and droplets would make a much better and more dramatic shot.<br/> <br/>well done for noticing this, seeing is half the battle in photography - really learning how to look.  now, the composition is the other vital element.  they both come with much practice, and looking at other artwork.<br/> <br/>well done, keep it up!</td>', 'i think the criticisms that have come before are all valid (size, slant) so i''ll go with what i like.  the subtlety is good, but i do believe a close up of only the bar, mesh and droplets would make a much better and more dramatic shot. well done for noticing this, seeing is half the battle in photography - really learning how to look.  now, the composition is the other vital element.  they both come with much practice, and looking at other artwork. well done, keep it up!', '2007-07-04 10:37:07.000000', NULL, 0),
