(3870752, 542761, 2764, '<td valign="top">Ignoring the challange theme, how does this photo stand?  Your lady in blue is so in-your-face that she must carry a message.  This isn''t just a "pretty picture", it''s more of a journalistic entry so I''m looking for a moral.  Are you suggesting that people are overweight?  That Spandex is out and blue jean shorts are in? That the worl is a drab place and a burst of color is needed?  If I look at the composition I find the bright blue butt in the rule-of-thirds sweet spot.  Ok, rules are for amateurs, you could say.  If I am an amateur viewer, my eye still goes to the woman''s backside.  Why do you want me to look there?  I''m I supposed to be amused?  Attracted?  In the end, I''m left wondering "Why did you want me to look at this photo?"  That doesn''t make it a bad photo, it means that it failed to communicate anything to me, the average dull voter.<br/> <br/>PS - I hate the border, I''m a member of the border police.</td>', 'Ignoring the challange theme, how does this photo stand?  Your lady in blue is so in-your-face that she must carry a message.  This isn''t just a "pretty picture", it''s more of a journalistic entry so I''m looking for a moral.  Are you suggesting that people are overweight?  That Spandex is out and blue jean shorts are in? That the worl is a drab place and a burst of color is needed?  If I look at the composition I find the bright blue butt in the rule-of-thirds sweet spot.  Ok, rules are for amateurs, you could say.  If I am an amateur viewer, my eye still goes to the woman''s backside.  Why do you want me to look there?  I''m I supposed to be amused?  Attracted?  In the end, I''m left wondering "Why did you want me to look at this photo?"  That doesn''t make it a bad photo, it means that it failed to communicate anything to me, the average dull voter. PS - I hate the border, I''m a member of the border police.', '2007-07-05 10:54:51.000000', NULL, 0),
