(3872547, 544032, 35720, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by PeterPic:</b></div><hr/><i> Very nicely done. I''ve seen this hut from before in a previous challenge.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=339633" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/500/thumb/339633.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/500/thumb/339633.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/500/thumb/339633.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>You have such beautiful landscapes and scenery in Iceland. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks for your comment Peter. Yes, this hut has been seen here on DPC before. This great photo you mention is my brother''s, but I have also sent a photo of it in a challenge before:<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=322607" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/481/thumb/322607.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/481/thumb/322607.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/481/thumb/322607.jpg"/></a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-07-05 17:12:13.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by PeterPic: Very nicely done. I''ve seen this hut from before in a previous challenge.   You have such beautiful landscapes and scenery in Iceland.   Thanks for your comment Peter. Yes, this hut has been seen here on DPC before. This great photo you mention is my brother''s, but I have also sent a photo of it in a challenge before: ', '2007-07-05 18:11:31.000000', '2007-07-05 18:12:13.000000', 0),
