(3872664, 542326, 44878, '<td valign="top">Goood Old England and not a Frenchie in sight.<br/>There is an Old Castle called Warkworth up in Northumberland with such an event in August.<br/>I cant Wait.<br/>Maybe your right about the ropes, its easy to say now, but it would have been worth taking the Time.<br/>I thought the Yankies would have gave you more interesting comments about the Heritage !<br/> <br/>Well Done<br/> <br/>ps  I like the Black n White fella for obvious reasons !</td>', 'Goood Old England and not a Frenchie in sight.There is an Old Castle called Warkworth up in Northumberland with such an event in August.I cant Wait.Maybe your right about the ropes, its easy to say now, but it would have been worth taking the Time.I thought the Yankies would have gave you more interesting comments about the Heritage ! Well Done ps  I like the Black n White fella for obvious reasons !', '2007-07-05 18:34:41.000000', NULL, 0),
