(3872875, 544132, 45250, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot Shane. Yes, it is tough getting a shot like that during a game. Timing has to be perfect. You can usually catch one on the break OR if someone''s in a snake. Might have scored higher had you stood left a bit.<br/>I didn''t vote, but would have definitely given it at least an 8. Great job.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-07-05 18:22:39.</i></td>', 'Excellent shot Shane. Yes, it is tough getting a shot like that during a game. Timing has to be perfect. You can usually catch one on the break OR if someone''s in a snake. Might have scored higher had you stood left a bit.I didn''t vote, but would have definitely given it at least an 8. Great job.', '2007-07-05 19:19:05.000000', '2007-07-05 19:22:39.000000', 0),
