(3882245, 544087, 30982, '<td valign="top">I very much like it.  Too often things here are simplified too much - here there''s enough to see to make the picture interesting and pleasing.  The eye can wander and take in the sights.  Love the overhanging lights!  And your post is very good as far as I can tell.</td>', 'I very much like it.  Too often things here are simplified too much - here there''s enough to see to make the picture interesting and pleasing.  The eye can wander and take in the sights.  Love the overhanging lights!  And your post is very good as far as I can tell.', '2007-07-08 15:48:30.000000', NULL, 0),
