<br/> <br/>This shot is very metaphorical, great effort and thank you.</td>', 'I am blown away by this shot! To my it brings home the reality of how wealthy and rich we all are. The brightness of the jelly beans fills me with childish laughter and the darkness of the background reminds me of the sinister world in which we live.  This shot is very metaphorical, great effort and thank you.', '2007-07-09 07:13:54.000000', NULL, 0),
