(4566860, 543949, 61552, '<td valign="top">In case anyone is wondering why the green in the foreground looks unreal, here''s why:<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=658360" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/61552/120/658360.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/61552/120/658360.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/61552/120/658360.jpg"/></a> <br/>I took the photo a few yards in front of my trailer at the campground and the lights behind me were green and intense.  I wish they weren''t there.</td>', 'In case anyone is wondering why the green in the foreground looks unreal, here''s why: I took the photo a few yards in front of my trailer at the campground and the lights behind me were green and intense.  I wish they weren''t there.', '2008-03-16 00:53:57.000000', NULL, 0),
