(3839763, 541865, 73747, '<td valign="top">Great sunset/sunrise image!  The red dot in the sky is a little distracting tho. Plus the challenge calls for using a colorful impact to offset your subject from the rest of the photograph.  But your entire photograph, with very little exception, is the subject... a sunset/sunrise.  But there is that little strip of land.  So its gotta be worth at least a 6.</td>', 'Great sunset/sunrise image!  The red dot in the sky is a little distracting tho. Plus the challenge calls for using a colorful impact to offset your subject from the rest of the photograph.  But your entire photograph, with very little exception, is the subject... a sunset/sunrise.  But there is that little strip of land.  So its gotta be worth at least a 6.', '2007-06-27 01:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3839771, 542750, 41535, '<td valign="top">Too dark and the colors don''t seem as saturated and bright as they could be.</td>', 'Too dark and the colors don''t seem as saturated and bright as they could be.', '2007-06-27 01:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
