(3841140, 543441, 66384, '<td valign="top">Lovely blossoms and lovely color. I think the focus is a little too soft. Also, the challenge details said: "Use a colorful impact <b>to offset your subject</b> from the rest of the photograph." In my opinion, this does not meet the challenge, because the color subject is the entire photo. However, I''m not going to vote down for that since it is just my interpretation of the challenge.</td>', 'Lovely blossoms and lovely color. I think the focus is a little too soft. Also, the challenge details said: "Use a colorful impact to offset your subject from the rest of the photograph." In my opinion, this does not meet the challenge, because the color subject is the entire photo. However, I''m not going to vote down for that since it is just my interpretation of the challenge.', '2007-06-27 10:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3841141, 542287, 70181, '<td valign="top">Nice close up.  But the lighting is pretty harsh.  Maybe try shooting earlier in the day or wait till some clouds pass over to shade it some.</td>', 'Nice close up.  But the lighting is pretty harsh.  Maybe try shooting earlier in the day or wait till some clouds pass over to shade it some.', '2007-06-27 10:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3841142, 540446, 66384, '<td valign="top">Interesting reverse use of color to offset the subject. I think the background is a little busy behind the base of the goblet, and my eye has a bit of trouble separating the two. Still kudos for original thinking and a nicely executed idea.</td>', 'Interesting reverse use of color to offset the subject. I think the background is a little busy behind the base of the goblet, and my eye has a bit of trouble separating the two. Still kudos for original thinking and a nicely executed idea.', '2007-06-27 10:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3841145, 544127, 33379, '<td valign="top">nice image.  i wouldve chose a different color for the border though.</td>', 'nice image.  i wouldve chose a different color for the border though.', '2007-06-27 10:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3841146, 544032, 77543, '<td valign="top">This must be in the top ten</td>', 'This must be in the top ten', '2007-06-27 10:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3841153, 544089, 66384, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color. You captured the iridescence nicely. I wish the lower background was a bit darker. I find it a bit distracting as it is.</td>', 'Beautiful color. You captured the iridescence nicely. I wish the lower background was a bit darker. I find it a bit distracting as it is.', '2007-06-27 10:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3841165, 543835, 70181, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  I like it centered.  You had a perfect sky for this shot.  Nice job.</td>', 'I really like this.  I like it centered.  You had a perfect sky for this shot.  Nice job.', '2007-06-27 10:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3841169, 543878, 66384, '<td valign="top">Beautiful flowers and beautiful colors. The yellow really gives a nice "back light" effect to the darker pink. I actually like the softness of the focus. I wonder if others will agree with me.</td>', 'Beautiful flowers and beautiful colors. The yellow really gives a nice "back light" effect to the darker pink. I actually like the softness of the focus. I wonder if others will agree with me.', '2007-06-27 10:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
