(3841180, 542630, 66384, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful image with beautiful color, focus and light. The challenge details said: "Use a colorful impact <b>to offset your subject</b> from the rest of the photograph." In my opinion, this does not meet the challenge, because the color subject is the entire photo. However, I''m not going to vote down for that since it is just my interpretation of the challenge and this is a stunning photo.</td>', 'This is a beautiful image with beautiful color, focus and light. The challenge details said: "Use a colorful impact to offset your subject from the rest of the photograph." In my opinion, this does not meet the challenge, because the color subject is the entire photo. However, I''m not going to vote down for that since it is just my interpretation of the challenge and this is a stunning photo.', '2007-06-27 10:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3841194, 542079, 66384, '<td valign="top">You certainly did find a great subject for this challenge. This image is a little over-saturated for my taste, but the impact is striking. I''m sure this will do very well.</td>', 'You certainly did find a great subject for this challenge. This image is a little over-saturated for my taste, but the impact is striking. I''m sure this will do very well.', '2007-06-27 10:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3841199, 544090, 79899, '<td valign="top">it looks like a bad tv signal..</td>', 'it looks like a bad tv signal..', '2007-06-27 10:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
