(3846362, 541686, 70181, '<td valign="top">I like the pose and just the hint of a smile on your face.  It would benefit from some brighter lighting on your clothes and face, but with basic editing and an outdoor shot, there''s not much you can do.</td>', 'I like the pose and just the hint of a smile on your face.  It would benefit from some brighter lighting on your clothes and face, but with basic editing and an outdoor shot, there''s not much you can do.', '2007-06-28 21:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
