(3849278, 543897, 53194, '<td valign="top">Might be nicer if the horizon was parallel and the umbrella wasn''t as close to the right edge of the photo</td>', 'Might be nicer if the horizon was parallel and the umbrella wasn''t as close to the right edge of the photo', '2007-06-29 17:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
