(3849382, 543897, 72852, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see the horizon line straight across, and it would be cool to see the foreground a little more in focus, but other than that this image is fantastic!  Great idea.  great use of color, and I can deal with the foreground out of focus with the depth of field honed in on the umbrella.</td>', 'I''d like to see the horizon line straight across, and it would be cool to see the foreground a little more in focus, but other than that this image is fantastic!  Great idea.  great use of color, and I can deal with the foreground out of focus with the depth of field honed in on the umbrella.', '2007-06-29 17:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3849386, 543943, 77838, '<td valign="top">Nice coloring out of a CD;...wondering to myself if you had any special lighting but I suppose not...</td>', 'Nice coloring out of a CD;...wondering to myself if you had any special lighting but I suppose not...', '2007-06-29 17:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3849390, 543796, 72852, '<td valign="top">Funny how the "Sprite!" is in a Coca Cola glass  :-)  Nice little burst of color.  I went back and forth on whether I wished the entire glass was in focus, but I think you made a good call keeping only the lemon in focus.</td>', 'Funny how the "Sprite!" is in a Coca Cola glass  :-)  Nice little burst of color.  I went back and forth on whether I wished the entire glass was in focus, but I think you made a good call keeping only the lemon in focus.', '2007-06-29 17:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
