(3849398, 541030, 72852, '<td valign="top">Don''t we all want to solve the cube this way?  One of the more clever concepts in this challenge.  I like the reflection in the cube...takes away the sterile feeling you could have created with the white background.</td>', 'Don''t we all want to solve the cube this way?  One of the more clever concepts in this challenge.  I like the reflection in the cube...takes away the sterile feeling you could have created with the white background.', '2007-06-29 17:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
