(3849403, 543037, 72852, '<td valign="top">The green bud in front of the orange flower is a little distracting.  I would like to see this image with the bud moved to the side or at least with the orange petals in sharper focus...if possible with the green out of focus.</td>', 'The green bud in front of the orange flower is a little distracting.  I would like to see this image with the bud moved to the side or at least with the orange petals in sharper focus...if possible with the green out of focus.', '2007-06-29 17:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
