(3850048, 543015, 70181, '<td valign="top">I think I like this because it''s selective desaturation without immediately looking like selective desaturation.  The clothing doesn''t look "wrong" being only black, white and gray.  It''s not until you notice the gray grass that you realize something is different.  And the red cross really draws your eyes in so that the gray grass isn''t that big of a deal.</td>', 'I think I like this because it''s selective desaturation without immediately looking like selective desaturation.  The clothing doesn''t look "wrong" being only black, white and gray.  It''s not until you notice the gray grass that you realize something is different.  And the red cross really draws your eyes in so that the gray grass isn''t that big of a deal.', '2007-06-29 22:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3850050, 543050, 70181, '<td valign="top">Good job on the longer exposure to show the flow of the water.</td>', 'Good job on the longer exposure to show the flow of the water.', '2007-06-29 22:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
